// A source-relative conditional layer-6 grant: the source has trample only
// while it is untapped ([CR#611.3a,613.1f]). This deliberately exposes a
// stored status toggle so the layer view can prove the grant appears and
// disappears across fresh derivations.
Normal(
    name: "Conditional trample source",
    mana_cost: [Generic(2), Green],
    types: [Creature],
    power: 2,
    toughness: 2,
    abilities: [
        Static(Conditionally(Matches(This, Status(Untapped)), Modify(This, GainAbility(Keyword(Trample))))),
    ],
)
